Policy: $HOME/.gridctl/models/policy.yaml

TARGET  STATE  PATH
litellm-fragment  drifted (restart-pending)  $HOME/.litellm/gridctl-models.yaml
litellm-include  drifted  $HOME/.litellm/config.yaml
opencode  stale  $HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json

litellm-fragment: the fragment was edited since gridctl wrote it

litellm-include: the include line was removed from the parent config

opencode: the policy changed since the last sync
